Boundless Oceans, Vast Skies: "Boundless Oceans, Vast Skies" (; lit.  "sea wide sky empty") is a song performed by the Hong Kong rock band Beyond.  Being released on 1993 in the Cantonese album "Rock and Roll", the song was massively popular.  The song has been also translated as "Under a Vast Sky", "Ocean Wide Sky High", "Vast Seas, Clear Skies", and

